Create and manage user-local strap sessions.

Usage:
  strap session new "repo analysis"
  strap session copy "alternate direction"
  strap session copy "alternate direction" --at bm_abc
  strap session ask "Analyze this repo"
  strap session show
  strap session save < state.json
  strap session list
  strap session path
  strap session state
  strap session trace
